    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WARNING! Do not play if you are Scared By Squares<br><br><strong>Scared by Squares</strong> is a creepy VR exploration game where you navigate liminal, cube-filled spaces that feel just a little too perfect. Something is off \u2014 and it\u2019s getting worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid roaming corrupted cubes, uncover hidden anomalies, and try to hold onto your sanity as the world slowly unravels around you. Play solo for a tense, immersive experience, or explore the unsettling halls with friends \u2014 if you think that will help.</p>",
